          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नागरिक — nāgarik — \"a citizen\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रत्येक नागरिकाला मत देण्याचा हक्क आहे. pratyek nāgarikālā mat deṇyācā hakka āhe. Every citizen has the right to vote."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नागरिक (nāgarik), both a man and a woman; नागरिकत्व, citizenship."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नागरिक (nāgarik) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit nāgarika, \"born or living in a town, civic\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
